<title>USA: Callaway Golf buys US Industries' Odyssey.</title>
<headline>Callaway Golf buys US Industries' Odyssey.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Callaway Golf Co on Monday said it has reached an agreement to buy all of the assets of Odyssey Sports Inc from US Industries Inc for $130 million in cash.</p>
<p>U.S. Industries said that as a result of the sale it expects to net proceeds of about $80 million, and generate an after-tax gain of about $50 million.</p>
<p>Odyssey Golf of Carlsbad, California, designs, produces and markets a leading brand of premium putters.</p>
